reSQL for main application data\n- MySQL 8.4 for WordPress\n- Automated deployments via GitHub push\n- Secret management via Northflank secret groups\n\n### Status\n- Backend: ✅ Running on Northflank\n- Frontend: ✅ Deployed with loading states fixed\n- WordPress: 🔄 Database import pending\n- Documentation: ✅ Organized in Storybook\n\n---\n\n## Previous Versions\n\n### 2026-07-17: Storybook A2UI Catalog & Deploy Fixes\n- Implemented Storybook A2UI design system catalog\n- Added API_BASE helper for environment configuration\n- Fixed deployment issues with SiteGround\n\n### 2026-07-16: A2UI Pattern Assembly Framework\n- Introduced A2UI (Agentic AI User Interface) pattern system\n- Created comprehensive documentation for agent integration\n- Implemented surface integration patterns\n- Added color philosophy documentation\n\n### 2026-07-15: Control Surface Implementation\n- Built three-column workspace layout\n- Integrated prompt IDE with execution environment\n- Added conversation scoping features\n- Implemented version control for prompt packages\n\n### Initial Release\n- Core prompt composer functionality\n- Dual-database architecture (PostgreSQL + Milvus)\n- Basic CRUD operations for prompt management\n- FastAPI backend with Python\n- React/TypeScript frontend with Vite"